cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this systematic-review corpus or replication package, please cite it."
title: "Context and Feedback in Repository-Level LLM Unit-Test Generation: Replication Package"
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: Mistry
    given-names: Diptajoy
abstract: >
  Public replication package for a systematic review of LLM-based unit-test
  generation focusing on context, feedback/repair, repository realism, and
  evaluation from executability through coverage and mutation to real-fault
  evidence. Frozen primary corpus: 64 studies; secondary surveys: 10.
  Corpus freeze: 2026-10-05. This package contains data, protocol, and
  reproduction scripts only (no manuscript).
keywords:
  - systematic review
  - replication package
  - large language models
  - unit test generation
  - mutation testing
  - fault detection
  - software testing
version: "1.0.0-pre"
date-released: "2026-10-08"
